Hi,

on some of our product, when we try to mount a partition rw, we got the error :
could not find an empty LEB and mount return "No space left on device".

Mounting ro works.

The log with debug enabled is attached.

Our ubifs tree is based on b06283c7df35b5a49ab141ed38e0280821379096 : "UBIFS:
make the dbg_lock spinlock static"

Newer commit don't show potential fix for the issue.


Have you got an idea of the problem ?


Thanks

Matthieu

